# Worker assets (design server)

These files are served to the headless-Chrome worker tab the Dart design
server drives over CDP. They are bundled inside the appboxd package (not under
`skills/appbox-designer/runtime/vendor/`) to keep Task 20 within its owned-files
boundary; `/assets/vendor/*` still serves from the runtime vendor dir.

- `worker_page.html` — the page the worker tab loads; carries the import map
  that remaps `node:fs` → `fs_shim.js` (the only Node builtin the artifact
  module graph uses; backed by a Dart-prefetched fixture map).
- `worker_shim.js` — the Hono-equivalent shim. Ports lib/helpers.mjs +
  lib/templates.mjs + lib/l10n.mjs + lib/state.mjs + lib/timers.mjs into the
  worker so viewmodels (authored against Hono's `c`) cannot tell the
  difference. Exposes `__boot` / `__routes` / `__dispatch`.
- `fs_shim.js` — the `node:fs` shim (sync readFileSync from globalThis.__fixtures).
- `nunjucks.min.js` — the Nunjucks **full** browser build (slim cannot compile
  templates at runtime; the design server renders from source, so the compiler
  is required).

